Partial #12 (gqf2008/brewfs)

First slice of the writer.rs decomposition: move tuning constants, env
overrides, writeback backpressure decision, buffer-wait and retry
classification into a new sibling module src/vfs/io/writer_policy.rs.
Pure code motion — no behavior change.

- writer.rs now re-imports the items via .
- writer tests (70) pass; clippy-clean.
- Remaining #12 work (still tracked): further writer.rs splitting
  (state machine / slice runtime), stats.rs split, and the redis store
  split which is deferred to the meta-service redesign.
